              "gap": 10,
              "padding": 28,
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "akkjm",
                  "name": "FAQQ_0",
                  "fill": "$text-primary",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Q01　今日決めないといけませんか？",
                  "fontFamily": "$font-jp",
                  "fontSize": 16,
                  "fontWeight": "700"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "Qz0uE",
                  "name": "FAQA_0",
                  "fill": "$text-secondary",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "解決策の選択肢や改善見込み額は、時間とともに変わっていく可能性があります。個別現状分析会は毎月の席数に限りがあるため、お早めのご相談をおすすめします。",
                  "lineHeight": 1.8,
                  "fontFamily": "$font-jp",
                  "fontSize": 13,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "rDgxy",
              "name": "FAQItem_1",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "fill": "$bg-gray",
              "cornerRadius": 4,
              "layout": "vertical",
              "gap": 10,
              "padding": 28,
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "TgBrW",
                  "name": "FAQQ_1",
                  "fill": "$text-primary",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Q02　パートナーに相談してから決めたいです",
                  "fontFamily": "$font-jp",
                  "fontSize": 16,
                  "fontWeight": "700"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "vaycv",
                  "name": "FAQA_1",
                  "fill": "$text-secondary",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "A　パートナーも同じ悩みを抱えているのであれば、まずはご自身の悩みを優先して解消することをおすすめします。",
                  "lineHeight": 1.8,
                  "fontFamily": "$font-jp",
                  "fontSize": 13,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "b4pmy",
              "name": "FAQItem_2",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "fill": "$bg-gray",
              "cornerRadius": 4,
              "layout": "vertical",
              "gap": 10,
              "padding": 28,
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "Gjf4y",
                  "name": "FAQQ_2",
                  "fill": "$text-primary",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Q03　忙しくて時間が取れません。やることは多いですか？",
                  "fontFamily": "$font-jp",
                  "fontSize": 16,
                  "fontWeight": "700"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "G71Vwm",
                  "name": "FAQA_2",
                  "fill": "$text-secondary",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "A　やっていただくことはたった2つです。①情報を丸投げ ②打合せへのご参加。情報の整理・ライフプラン表作成・課題分析など9つの工程は、すべて私たちが代行します。",
                  "lineHeight": 1.8,
                  "fontFamily": "$font-jp",
                  "fontSize": 13,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "tIjWc",
              "name": "FAQItem_3",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "fill": "$bg-gray",
              "cornerRadius": 4,
              "layout": "vertical",
              "gap": 10,
              "padding": 28,
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "ZSs5a",
                  "name": "FAQQ_3",
                  "fill": "$text-primary",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Q04　担当者は誰がつきますか？",
                  "fontFamily": "$font-jp",
                  "fontSize": 16,
                  "fontWeight": "700"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "XkfWV",
                  "name": "FAQA_3",
                  "fill": "$text-secondary",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "A　原則、2名の専属担当者がサポートします（ヒアリング担当・フォロー担当、コンサルティング担当）。チームミーティングを行い、それぞれの知見から最適な解決策を提案するため、担当者によって質が変わることはありません。",
                  "lineHeight": 1.8,
                  "fontFamily": "$font-jp",
                  "fontSize": 13,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "h3y94",
              "name": "FAQItem_4",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "fill": "$bg-gray",
              "cornerRadius": 4,
              "layout": "vertical",
              "gap": 10,
              "padding": 28,
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "NSlah",
                  "name": "FAQQ_4",
                  "fill": "$text-primary",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Q05　個別伴走サポートは無制限で相談できますか？",
                  "fontFamily": "$font-jp",
                  "fontSize": 16,
                  "fontWeight": "700"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "YXu74",
                  "name": "FAQA_4",
                  "fill": "$text-secondary",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "A　初回打合せから3か月を目安にサポートしています。",
                  "lineHeight": 1.8,
                  "fontFamily": "$font-jp",
                  "fontSize": 13,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "E6Wif",
              "name": "FAQItem_5",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "fill": "$bg-gray",
              "cornerRadius": 4,
              "layout": "vertical",
              "gap": 10,
              "padding": 28,
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "LKaIv",
                  "name": "FAQQ_5",
                  "fill": "$text-primary",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Q06　どんなことでも相談できますか？",
                  "fontFamily": "$font-jp",
                  "fontSize": 16,
                  "fontWeight": "700"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "k7fs3",
                  "name": "FAQA_5",
                  "fill": "$text-secondary",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "A　以下はご対応できません。①税理士業務　②根拠のない断言（投資タイミング・個別銘柄の推奨）",
                  "lineHeight": 1.8,
                  "fontFamily": "$font-jp",
                  "fontSize": 13,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "k6JQP",
              "name": "FAQItem_6",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "fill": "$bg-gray",
              "cornerRadius": 4,
              "layout": "vertical",
              "gap": 10,
              "padding": 28,
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "J74bO",
                  "name": "FAQQ_6",
                  "fill": "$text-primary",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Q07　返金保証とは何ですか？",
                  "fontFamily": "$font-jp",
                  "fontSize": 16,
                  "fontWeight": "700"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "lHJyL",
                  "name": "FAQA_6",
                  "fill": "$text-secondary",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "A　ご提供するサービスにご満足いただけなかった場合、全額返金いたします。（※打合せキャンセルの多発や解決策実行アクションがない等、適切なご協力が得られない場合は返金対象外となることがあります）",
                  "lineHeight": 1.8,
                  "fontFamily": "$font-jp",
                  "fontSize": 13,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "p7hiO",
              "name": "FAQItem_7",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "fill": "$bg-gray",
              "cornerRadius": 4,
              "layout": "vertical",
              "gap": 10,
              "padding": 28,
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "F3XBiA",
                  "name": "FAQQ_7",
                  "fill": "$text-primary",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Q08　個別現状分析会は本当に無料ですか？",
                  "fontFamily": "$font-jp",
                  "fontSize": 16,
                  "fontWeight": "700"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "E6WzQ",
                  "name": "FAQA_7",
                  "fill": "$text-secondary",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "A　はい、無料でご案内しています。ただし毎月席数限定・審査制のため、ご希望されても受けられない場合があります。",
                  "lineHeight": 1.8,
                  "fontFamily": "$font-jp",
                  "fontSize": 13,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "TGHfc",
              "name": "FAQItem_8",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "fill": "$bg-gray",
              "cornerRadius": 4,
              "layout": "vertical",
              "gap": 10,
              "padding": 28,
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "kqZqk",
                  "name": "FAQQ_8",
                  "fill": "$text-primary",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Q09　対面勉強会と個別現状分析会は何が違いますか？",
                  "fontFamily": "$font-jp",
                  "fontSize": 16,
                  "fontWeight": "700"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "tbhUp",
                  "name": "FAQA_8",
                  "fill": "$text-secondary",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "A　対面勉強会は複数名でのワーク形式の講座、個別現状分析会は1対1であなたの状況を分析する相談です。まずは対面勉強会、その後に個別現状分析会という流れもご案内しています。",
                  "lineHeight": 1.8,
                  "fontFamily": "$font-jp",
                  "fontSize": 13,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "n57ge",
              "name": "FAQItem_9",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "fill": "$bg-gray",
              "cornerRadius": 4,
              "layout": "vertical",
              "gap": 10,
              "padding": 28,
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "h3yyx",
                  "name": "FAQQ_9",
                  "fill": "$text-primary",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Q10　対面勉強会に参加しないと相談できませんか？",
                  "fontFamily": "$font-jp",
                  "fontSize": 16,
                  "fontWeight": "700"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "djG9r",
                  "name": "FAQA_9",
                  "fill": "$text-secondary",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "A　参加は任意です。遠方の方などはオンラインでの個別相談にも対応しています。",
                  "lineHeight": 1.8,
                  "fontFamily": "$font-jp",
                  "fontSize": 13,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "w9yf4x",
              "name": "FAQItem_10",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "fill": "$bg-gray",
              "cornerRadius": 4,
              "layout": "vertical",
              "gap": 10,
              "padding": 28,
              "children": [
